{"n":65,"name":"At-Talaq","nameAr":"الطلاق","meaning":"The Divorce","ayahs":12,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":28,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ إِذَا طَلَّقْتُمُ ٱلنِّسَآءَ فَطَلِّقُوهُنَّ لِعِدَّتِهِنَّ وَأَحْصُوا۟ ٱلْعِدَّةَ ۖ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ رَبَّكُمْ ۖ لَا تُخْرِجُوهُنَّ مِنۢ بُيُوتِهِنَّ وَلَا يَخْرُجْنَ إِلَّآ أَن يَأْتِينَ بِفَـٰحِشَةٍ مُّبَيِّنَةٍ ۚ وَتِلْكَ حُدُودُ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَمَن يَتَعَدَّ حُدُودَ ٱللَّهِ فَقَدْ ظَلَمَ نَفْسَهُۥ ۚ لَا تَدْرِى لَعَلَّ ٱللَّهَ يُحْدِثُ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ أَمْرًا","en":"O Prophet, when you [Muslims] divorce women, divorce them for [the commencement of] their waiting period and keep count of the waiting period, and fear Allāh, your Lord. Do not turn them out of their [husbands'] houses, nor should they [themselves] leave [during that period] unless they are committing a clear immorality. And those are the limits [set by] Allāh. And whoever transgresses the limits of Allāh has certainly wronged himself. You know not; perhaps Allāh will bring about after that a [different] matter.","w":[{"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","tr":"yāayyuhā","en":"O","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","tr":"l-nabiyu","en":"Prophet","root":"نبأ","lem":"نَبِيّ"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"When"},{"ar":"طَلَّقْتُمُ","tr":"ṭallaqtumu","en":"you divorce","root":"طلق","lem":"طَلَّقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءَ","tr":"l-nisāa","en":"[the] women","root":"نسو","lem":"نِساء"},{"ar":"فَطَلِّقُوهُنَّ","tr":"faṭalliqūhunna","en":"then divorce them","root":"طلق","lem":"طَلَّقَ"},{"ar":"لِعِدَّتِهِنَّ","tr":"liʿiddatihinna","en":"for their waiting period","root":"عدد","lem":"عِدَّة"},{"ar":"وَأَحْصُوا۟","tr":"wa-aḥṣū","en":"and keep count","root":"حصي","lem":"أَحْصَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْعِدَّةَ ۖ","tr":"l-ʿidata","en":"(of) the waiting period","root":"عدد","lem":"عِدَّة"},{"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","tr":"wa-ittaqū","en":"and fear","root":"وقي","lem":"اتَّقَى"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"رَبَّكُمْ ۖ","tr":"rabbakum","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(Do) not"},{"ar":"تُخْرِجُوهُنَّ","tr":"tukh'rijūhunna","en":"expel them","root":"خرج","lem":"أَخْرَجَ"},{"ar":"مِنۢ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"بُيُوتِهِنَّ","tr":"buyūtihinna","en":"their houses","root":"بيت","lem":"بَيْت"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"يَخْرُجْنَ","tr":"yakhruj'na","en":"they should leave","root":"خرج","lem":"خَرَجَ"},{"ar":"إِلَّآ","tr":"illā","en":"except"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"يَأْتِينَ","tr":"yatīna","en":"they commit","root":"أتي","lem":"أَتَى"},{"ar":"بِفَـٰحِشَةٍۢ","tr":"bifāḥishatin","en":"an immorality","root":"فحش","lem":"فاحِشَة"},{"ar":"مُّبَيِّنَةٍۢ ۚ","tr":"mubayyinatin","en":"clear","root":"بين","lem":"مُبَيِّنَة"},{"ar":"وَتِلْكَ","tr":"watil'ka","en":"And these"},{"ar":"حُدُودُ","tr":"ḥudūdu","en":"(are the) limits","root":"حدد","lem":"حُدُود"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَمَن","tr":"waman","en":"And whoever"},{"ar":"يَتَعَدَّ","tr":"yataʿadda","en":"transgresses","root":"عدو","lem":"يَتَعَدَّ"},{"ar":"حُدُودَ","tr":"ḥudūda","en":"(the) limits","root":"حدد","lem":"حُدُود"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"فَقَدْ","tr":"faqad","en":"then certainly"},{"ar":"ظَلَمَ","tr":"ẓalama","en":"he has wronged","root":"ظلم","lem":"ظَلَمَ"},{"ar":"نَفْسَهُۥ ۚ","tr":"nafsahu","en":"himself","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"تَدْرِى","tr":"tadrī","en":"you know","root":"دري","lem":"تَدْرِي"},{"ar":"لَعَلَّ","tr":"laʿalla","en":"Perhaps"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يُحْدِثُ","tr":"yuḥ'dithu","en":"will bring about","root":"حدث","lem":"يُحْدِثُ"},{"ar":"بَعْدَ","tr":"baʿda","en":"after","root":"بعد","lem":"بَعْد"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"that"},{"ar":"أَمْرًۭا","tr":"amran","en":"a matter","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"}]},{"n":2,"juz":28,"ar":"فَإِذَا بَلَغْنَ أَجَلَهُنَّ فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ بِمَعْرُوفٍ أَوْ فَارِقُوهُنَّ بِمَعْرُوفٍ وَأَشْهِدُوا۟ ذَوَىْ عَدْلٍ مِّنكُمْ وَأَقِيمُوا۟ ٱلشَّهَـٰدَةَ لِلَّهِ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ يُوعَظُ بِهِۦ مَن كَانَ يُؤْمِنُ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۚ وَمَن يَتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ يَجْعَل لَّهُۥ مَخْرَجًا","en":"And when they have [nearly] fulfilled their term, either retain them according to acceptable terms or part with them according to acceptable terms. And bring to witness two just men from among you and establish the testimony for [the acceptance of] Allāh. That is instructed to whoever should believe in Allāh and the Last Day. And whoever fears Allāh - He will make for him a way out","w":[{"ar":"فَإِذَا","tr":"fa-idhā","en":"Then when"},{"ar":"بَلَغْنَ","tr":"balaghna","en":"they have reached","root":"بلغ","lem":"بَلَغَ"},{"ar":"أَجَلَهُنَّ","tr":"ajalahunna","en":"their term","root":"أجل","lem":"أَجَل"},{"ar":"فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ","tr":"fa-amsikūhunna","en":"then retain them","root":"مسك","lem":"أَمْسَكَ"},{"ar":"بِمَعْرُوفٍ","tr":"bimaʿrūfin","en":"with kindness","root":"عرف","lem":"مَعْرُوف"},{"ar":"أَوْ","tr":"aw","en":"or"},{"ar":"فَارِقُوهُنَّ","tr":"fāriqūhunna","en":"part with them","root":"فرق","lem":"فارِقُ"},{"ar":"بِمَعْرُوفٍۢ","tr":"bimaʿrūfin","en":"with kindness","root":"عرف","lem":"مَعْرُوف"},{"ar":"وَأَشْهِدُوا۟","tr":"wa-ashhidū","en":"And take witness","root":"شهد","lem":"أَشْهَدَ"},{"ar":"ذَوَىْ","tr":"dhaway","en":"two men"},{"ar":"عَدْلٍۢ","tr":"ʿadlin","en":"just","root":"عدل","lem":"عَدْل"},{"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","tr":"minkum","en":"among you"},{"ar":"وَأَقِيمُوا۟","tr":"wa-aqīmū","en":"and establish","root":"قوم","lem":"أَقامَ"},{"ar":"ٱلشَّهَـٰدَةَ","tr":"l-shahādata","en":"the testimony","root":"شهد","lem":"شَهادَة"},{"ar":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","tr":"lillahi","en":"for Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","tr":"dhālikum","en":"That"},{"ar":"يُوعَظُ","tr":"yūʿaẓu","en":"is instructed","root":"وعظ","lem":"وَعَظْ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ","