{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"بَـٰلِغُ","tr":"bālighu","en":"(will) accomplish","root":"بلغ","lem":"بالِغ"},{"ar":"أَمْرِهِۦ ۚ","tr":"amrihi","en":"His purpose","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"قَدْ","tr":"qad","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"جَعَلَ","tr":"jaʿala","en":"has set","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لِكُلِّ","tr":"likulli","en":"for every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","tr":"shayin","en":"thing","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"قَدْرًۭا","tr":"qadran","en":"a measure","root":"قدر","lem":"قَدْر"}]},{"n":4,"juz":28,"ar":"وَٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى يَئِسْنَ مِنَ ٱلْمَحِيضِ مِن نِّسَآئِكُمْ إِنِ ٱرْتَبْتُمْ فَعِدَّتُهُنَّ ثَلَـٰثَةُ أَشْهُرٍ وَٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى لَمْ يَحِضْنَ ۚ وَأُو۟لَـٰتُ ٱلْأَحْمَالِ أَجَلُهُنَّ أَن يَضَعْنَ حَمْلَهُنَّ ۚ وَمَن يَتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ يَجْعَل لَّهُۥ مِنْ أَمْرِهِۦ يُسْرًا","en":"And those who no longer expect menstruation among your women - if you doubt, then their period is three months, and [also for] those who have not menstruated. And for those who are pregnant, their term is until they give birth. And whoever fears Allāh - He will make for him of his matter ease.","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى","tr":"wa-allāī","en":"And those who"},{"ar":"يَئِسْنَ","tr":"ya-is'na","en":"have despaired","root":"يأس","lem":"يَئِسَ"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَحِيضِ","tr":"l-maḥīḍi","en":"the menstruation","root":"حيض","lem":"مَحِيض"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"among"},{"ar":"نِّسَآئِكُمْ","tr":"nisāikum","en":"your women","root":"نسو","lem":"نِساء"},{"ar":"إِنِ","tr":"ini","en":"if"},{"ar":"ٱرْتَبْتُمْ","tr":"ir'tabtum","en":"you doubt","root":"ريب","lem":"ارْتابَ"},{"ar":"فَعِدَّتُهُنَّ","tr":"faʿiddatuhunna","en":"then their waiting period","root":"عدد","lem":"عِدَّة"},{"ar":"ثَلَـٰثَةُ","tr":"thalāthatu","en":"(is) three","root":"ثلث","lem":"ثَلاثَة"},{"ar":"أَشْهُرٍۢ","