aha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يُكَفِّرْ","tr":"yukaffir","en":"He will remove","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَّرَ"},{"ar":"عَنْهُ","tr":"ʿanhu","en":"from him"},{"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِۦ","tr":"sayyiātihi","en":"his evil deeds","root":"سوأ","lem":"سَيِّئَة"},{"ar":"وَيُعْظِمْ","tr":"wayuʿ'ẓim","en":"and make great","root":"عظم","lem":"يُعْظِمْ"},{"ar":"لَهُۥٓ","tr":"lahu","en":"for him"},{"ar":"أَجْرًا","tr":"ajran","en":"(his) reward","root":"أجر","lem":"أَجْر"}]},{"n":6,"juz":28,"ar":"أَسْكِنُوهُنَّ مِنْ حَيْثُ سَكَنتُم مِّن وُجْدِكُمْ وَلَا تُضَآرُّوهُنَّ لِتُضَيِّقُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ ۚ وَإِن كُنَّ أُو۟لَـٰتِ حَمْلٍ فَأَنفِقُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ حَتَّىٰ يَضَعْنَ حَمْلَهُنَّ ۚ فَإِنْ أَرْضَعْنَ لَكُمْ فَـَٔاتُوهُنَّ أُجُورَهُنَّ ۖ وَأْتَمِرُوا۟ بَيْنَكُم بِمَعْرُوفٍ ۖ وَإِن تَعَاسَرْتُمْ فَسَتُرْضِعُ لَهُۥٓ أُخْرَىٰ","en":"Lodge them [in a section] of where you dwell out of your means and do not harm them in order to oppress them. And if they should be pregnant, then spend on them until they give birth. And if they breastfeed for you, then give them their payment and confer among yourselves in the acceptable way; but if you are in discord, then there may breastfeed for him [i.e., the father] another woman.","w":[{"ar":"أَسْكِنُوهُنَّ","tr":"askinūhunna","en":"Lodge them","root":"سكن","lem":"أَسْكَن"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"حَيْثُ","tr":"ḥaythu","en":"where","root":"حيث","lem":"حَيْث"},{"ar":"سَكَنتُم","tr":"sakantum","en":"you dwell","root":"سكن","lem":"سَكَنَ"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"(out) of"},{"ar":"وُجْدِكُمْ","tr":"wuj'dikum","en":"your means","root":"وجد","lem":"وُجْد"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and (do) not"},{"ar":"تُضَآرُّوهُنَّ","tr":"tuḍārrūhunna","en":"harm them","root":"ضرر","lem":"يُضارَّ"},{"ar":"لِتُضَيِّقُوا۟","tr":"lituḍayyiqū","en":"to distress","root":"ضيق","lem":"تُضَيِّقُ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِنَّ ۚ","tr":"ʿalayhinna","en":"[on] them"},{"ar":"وَإِن","tr":"wa-in","en":"And if"},{"ar":"كُنَّ","tr":"kunna","en